Description: Wild OS Notes
 Notes keeps notes in notebooks, with checklists, headings, links,
 pictures and tables, pinned notes and # tags, and searches every title
 and word. Each note is a Markdown file in ~/Notes, one folder per
 notebook, readable in any text editor, and saved as you type. Super+N
 opens a quick note from anywhere, even when Notes is closed. Nothing is
 sent anywhere: no accounts, no sync and no tracking.
